Package: com.techieben.benscertfix
Name: Ben's Cert Fix
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Fixes "cannot connect" errors on websites and apps by adding up-to-date root certificates (Let's Encrypt, Amazon, Google, DigiCert and more) that old iOS doesn't have.
Maintainer: techieben
Author: techieben
Section: System
Depends: firmware (>= 5.0)
